  "question": {
    "text": "Let <math><msub><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi></mi><msub><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub></math> be three positive numbers which are in geometric progression with common ratio <math><mi>r</mi></math>. The inequality <math><msub><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub><mo>&gt;</mo><msub><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></math> holds true if <math><mi>r</mi></math> is equal to"
